                        "content": "The nurse is assessing a client diagnosed with a ureteral stricture. Which clinical manifestations would support this diagnosis?",
                        "subjectId": "ad5ab04c79144c0ea9b83385308c3b1d",
                        "difficultyIds": "11797937e327eb6d913faa80427c566b",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Analyzing 分析",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nA ureteral stricture results in narrowing of the ureter, which can occur along any point of the ureter. Ureteral strictures usually form due to adhesions or scar tissue related to surgery or radiation, but they can be congenital in nature. Clinical manifestations of a ureteral stricture include mild to moderate colic and flank pain. Options 1, 2, and 4 are unrelated to a ureteral stricture. Therefore, option 3 is correct as colicky flank pain occurs when urine is unable to effectively pass through the stricture.\n",
                        "id": "1fd48ab571c34dd2a8f1b8d438c3f75c",
                        "mark": "0",
                        "collectionState": "0"
                    },
                    {
                        "optionList": [
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "16843523071146d494f0f7e240a52a2e",
                                "content": "Reorient the client."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "1",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "06c9302f56474b17bed22a5ad4588b54",
                                "content": "Notify the surgeon."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "7bd81e71be5b49d99224d777f3dff7fd",
                                "content": "Ensure that a clock and calendar are in the room."
                            },
